.SS "Ensemble Framework"
The ensemble runner processes realisations in batches of up to
.B \-\-batch\-size
concurrent runs.  Each completed realisation triggers:
.RS
.IP 1. 4
A Welford online update to the running mean and variance of mass_gen1.
.IP 2.
An atomic checkpoint write (bincode serialisation with provenance hash).
.IP 3.
Convergence check: if relative standard error of mass_gen1 drops below
.BR \-\-target\-error ,
the loop stops early.
.RE
.PP
Between batches, intermediate CSV snapshots
.RI ( results_MNN.csv ,
.IR topology_summary_MNN.csv ,
.IR mass_spectrum_MNN.csv )
are written for monitoring long runs.  The
.B \-\-resume
flag reads
.I .checkpoint.bin
from the output directory and skips completed realisations.
.PP
