.SS "provenance \(em Provenance System"
Five-layer SHA-256 provenance system implemented without external crate
dependencies (minimal SHA-256 in pure Rust, limited to two-block messages).
.TP
.BI "verify_provenance() \(-> bool"
Compute SHA-256 of PROVENANCE_PREIMAGE and compare against the embedded
